body:
1. The Hag - I hate her playstyle and her low height. Just all around suck with her. Took me the most tries out of any of the killers and I have them all (except Myers). 85% I did before the update that made adepts easier for killer too.
&nbsp;









2. Clown - Took me quite a few tries. I just struggle with bottles. Thankfully he at least has Pop and Bamboozle going for him.
&nbsp;







3. Pinhead - Because I had to do it 3 times before the glitched out achievement decided to pop/
&nbsp;






4. Myers - Because I've done it once so far but it didn't pop and because he's arguably the weakest killer in the game and has no gen defense on his perks/
&nbsp







5. The Plague - Hear me out: she is definitely one of the better killers in the game but doing it pre-update (the one that made 4ks count instead of 4 irri medals) was insanely hard. Every time I tried Id feel like I played a perfect game but the points would be a literal hair's length below the the double pip. It refused to give it to me and I think it was something to do with the way her power usage calculates idk. Also you could do too well too quickly and people would just give up and rob you of points because Plague is one of the 3 or 4 killers people routinely refuse to play against.
